## Audit

none — `00-use-case.md`'s `Audit` row is `none` for this aggregate.

The document family takes `stamps` only (`@.claude/rules/persistence.md` § Auditing · Document):
a `DocumentAuditStamps stamps` field on the document, filled by `@EnableMongoAuditing` keyed on
its `@Version` — `AuditedEntity.java.example` (last block) and `AuditingConfig.java.example`. A
`history` row stops the pass before this block is written.

| Item | Decision |
|---|---|
| Level | `stamps` — `00-use-case.md` § Audit |
| Actor | as the relational shape: the principal, `anonymous`, or `system:<name>` under `SystemActor` |

